            s_sales: `Sales for the year on her sheet: Centro {sC} · Norte {sN} · Sur {sS} · Online shop {sO}.`,
            s_cases: `Business case on today’s sheet: Norte rep {vN} · online shop {vO} · minimum order {vM} ({small} small customers).`,
