            cm_debrief: `A sales file is not data until someone cleans it: duplicates removed by key, every return counted once, a complete year without VAT. Then you measure what is left of each euro, not just what is sold, count customers by what identifies them, separate what will not recur, reconcile with accounting and compare every option on the same criteria. A data-backed recommendation is one that can be shown and that says how far it might be wrong. The model is deterministic: the same decisions always give the same result.`,
